      6 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تعاوت الكِلَابُ</span></b>  <i>The dogs cried,</i> or <i>cried loudly,</i>
[meaning <i>howled,</i>] <i>one to another.</i> (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  And
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَعَاوَوْا عَلَيْهِ</span>, (K, TA,) and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَغَاوَوْا</span>, (TA,) <i>They
collected themselves together,</i> (K, TA,) or <i>aided
one another,</i> (TA,) <i>against him.</i> (K, TA.)

